{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q009:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第9题\n知识标签：复数、abs()、模长、浮点数显示\n\n下面语句输出正确的是\n\n```pycon\n>>>abs(-3+4j)\n```\n\nA. 3\n\nB. 4\n\nC. 5\n\nD. 5.0\n\n原PDF参考答案：D\n来源：物理PDF第9页，9.D。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q009", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 9, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [3], "topic_tags": ["复数", "abs()", "模长", "浮点数显示"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": ["display_form_matters"], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
