{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q011:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第11题\n知识标签：字符串索引、负索引、字符串切片、print()\n\n如果 name =“全国计算机等级考试二级 Python”下面输出错误的是\n\nA.\n\n```pycon\n>>> print(name[0], name[8], name[-1])\n全 试\n```\n\nB.\n\n```pycon\n>>>print(name[:])\n全国计算机等级考试二级 Python\n```\n\nC.\n\n```pycon\n>>> print(name[11:])\nPython\n```\n\nD.\n\n```pycon\n>>> print(name[:11])\n全国计算机等级考试二级\n```\n\n原PDF参考答案：A\n来源：物理PDF第9页，11.A。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q011", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 11, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [3], "topic_tags": ["字符串索引", "负索引", "字符串切片", "print()"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": ["whitespace_layout"], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q013:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第13题\n知识标签：字符串格式化、format()、最小字段宽度\n\n下列程序运行结果正确的是\n\n```pycon\n>>> s = 'PYTHON'\n>>> \"{0:3}\".format(s)\n```\n\nA. ‘PYT’\n\nB. ‘PYTH’\n\nC. ‘PYTHON’\n\nD. ‘ PYTHON’\n\n原PDF参考答案：C\n来源：物理PDF第9页，13.C。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q013", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 13, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [4], "topic_tags": ["字符串格式化", "format()", "最小字段宽度"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": ["option_spacing_layout"], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q017:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第17题\n知识标签：函数、代码复用、参数、函数调用\n\n下面关于函数描述不正确的是\n\nA. 函数是一段具有特定功能的语句组。\n\nB. 函数是一段可重用的语句组。\n\nC. 函数通过函数名进行调用。\n\nD. 每次使用函数需要提供相同的参数作为输入。\n\n原PDF参考答案：D\n来源：物理PDF第9页，17.D。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q017", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 17, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [4], "topic_tags": ["函数", "代码复用", "参数", "函数调用"], "difficulty": 1, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
