{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q019:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第19题\n知识标签：递归、基例、递归深度、异常\n\n关于递归描述不正确的是\n\nA. 函数定义中调用函数自身的方式称为递归。\n\nB. 递归只能存在一个基例。\n\nC. 默认情况下，当递归调用到 1000 层，Python 解释器将终止程序。\n\nD. 递归不是循环。\n\n原PDF参考答案：B\n来源：物理PDF第9页，19.B。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q019", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 19, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [5], "topic_tags": ["递归", "基例", "递归深度", "异常"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": ["implementation_specific_claim"], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q021:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第21题\n知识标签：元组、序列、不可变性、嵌套容器\n\n下面对元组描述不正确的是\n\nA. 元组是一种集合类型。\n\nB. 元组一旦被创建就不能被修改。\n\nC. 一个元组可以作为另外一个元组的元素。\n\nD. Python 语言中元组可以采用逗号和圆括号来表示。\n\n原PDF参考答案：A\n来源：物理PDF第9页，21.A。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q021", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 21, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [5], "topic_tags": ["元组", "序列", "不可变性", "嵌套容器"], "difficulty": 1, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q022:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第22题\n知识标签：列表、嵌套列表、len()、顶层元素\n\n列表 ls=[[1,2,3],[[4,5],6],[7,8]]，则 len(ls)的值是\n\nA. 1\n\nB. 3\n\nC. 4\n\nD. 8\n\n原PDF参考答案：B\n来源：物理PDF第9页，22.B。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q022", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 22, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [5], "topic_tags": ["列表", "嵌套列表", "len()", "顶层元素"], "difficulty": 1, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q023:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第23题\n知识标签：字典、键、可哈希性、列表、元组\n\n下面是错误的字典创建方式的是\n\nA. d = {1:[1,2], 3:[3,4]}\n\nB. d = {[1,2]:1, [3,4]:3}\n\nC. d = {(1,2):1, (3,4):3}\n\nD. d = {'张三':1, '李四':2}\n\n原PDF参考答案：B\n来源：物理PDF第9页，23.B。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q023", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 23, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [5, 6], "topic_tags": ["字典", "键", "可哈希性", "列表", "元组"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q025:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第25题\n知识标签：文件、文本模式、二进制模式、数据存储\n\n下面对文件描述错误的是\n\nA. 文件是一个存储在辅助存储器上的数据序列。\n\nB. 文件中可以包含任何数据内容。\n\nC. 文本文件和二进制文件都是文件。\n\nD. 文本文件不能用二进制文件方式读入。\n\n原PDF参考答案：D\n来源：物理PDF第9页，25.D。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q025", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 25, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [6], "topic_tags": ["文件", "文本模式", "二进制模式", "数据存储"], "difficulty": 1, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
{"id": "ncre-python-sample-q026:answer:v1", "text": "全国计算机等级考试（NCRE）二级 Python 语言程序设计 样题及参考答案\n一、单项选择题 第26题\n知识标签：嵌套索引、列表、字符串、负索引\n\n假设 ls = [3.5, “Python”, [10, “LIST”], 3.6]，则执行 ls[2][-1][1]的结果为\n\nA. L\n\nB. I\n\nC. P\n\nD. Y\n\n原PDF参考答案：B\n来源：物理PDF第9页，26.B。原卷未提供解析。", "metadata": {"visibility": "internal_answer", "question_id": "ncre-python-sample-q026", "document_id": "31a16a56-e947-505e-948a-a7075fd42ea0", "document_type": "sample_exam", "document_sha256": "a0f6a19967464aba6bbb5150d4311311672179c963f631eeed6745e7f4956fd8", "source_path": "python考试真题/二级Python语言程序设计——样题及参考答案.pdf", "exam_year": null, "question_number": 26, "section": "一、单项选择题", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "pdf_pages": [6], "topic_tags": ["嵌套索引", "列表", "字符串", "负索引"], "difficulty": 2, "annotation_origin": "project_annotation", "answer_available": true, "review_status": "draft", "retrieval_ready": true, "quality_flags": [], "runtime_curriculum_eligible": false, "asset_paths": [], "answer_pdf_pages": [9]}}
